@startuml system context diagram
title Posterys - Target System Context

!theme plain
left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #475569

actor "User\nStudent / office worker" as User

rectangle "Posterys\nIntegrated posture analysis system\nWeb and desktop applications" as Posterys

rectangle "Webcamera\nExternal capture device" as Camera

rectangle "Operating system\nCamera access, tray and notifications" as OS

User -right-> Posterys : Starts sessions, uploads media,\nviews feedback, history and reports

Camera -down-> Posterys : Camera frames\nwith user permission

Posterys -right-> OS : Requests camera access;\nuses tray and notifications on desktop

note bottom of Posterys
  Planned system boundary.
  The current prototype implements
  local webcam analysis and visual feedback.
end note

@enduml